{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BQ16beer5jGzommCZ7VFwg","type":"tool_result","content":"['instance_name', 'cell', 'generator', 'n', 'm', 'param', 'index', 'seed', 'solve_seconds', 'optimum', 'solve_nodes', 'solve_proof', 'certified', 'witness_ok', 'status_default', 'nodes_default', 'seconds_default', 'status_csearch', 'nodes_csearch', 'seconds_csearch', 'n_customers', 'n_patterns', 'n_ones', 'density', 'shape_ratio', 'distinct_col_frac', 'distinct_row_frac', 'dominated_col_frac', 'row_min', 'row_max', 'row_mean', 'row_std', 'col_min', 'col_max', 'col_mean', 'col_std', 'col_max_frac', 'g_nodes', 'g_edges', 'g_density', 'g_components', 'g_largest_comp_frac', 'g_clustering', 'g_degeneracy', 'g_deg_min', 'g_deg_max', 'g_deg_mean', 'g_deg_std', 'lb_trivial', 'lb_contraction', 'lb_best', 'ub_mcn', 'ub_cs_dfs', 'ub_best', 'bound_gap', 'bound_gap_frac', 'tw_min_fill', 'tw_min_degree', 'bw_rcm', 'spectral_radius', 'fiedler', 'fiedler_lcc', 'cc_products', 'cc_greedy', 'sep_size', 'sep_frac', 'rig_edge_prob', 'rig_deg_expected', 'rig_density_ratio', 'feature_seconds', 'matrix_digest', 'graph_cert', 'bipartite_cert', 'wl_hash', 'aut_order', 'complete_graph', 'total_seconds']\n6785\n         cells  inst  sec_med\nn   m                        \n50  25      15   750  0.00200\n    50      15   750  0.00185\n    100     15   750  0.00100\n60  30      15   750  0.00760\n    60      15   750  0.00645\n    120     15   750  0.00200\n75  37      15   750  0.05810\n    75      15   750  0.04025\n    150     15   747  0.00920\n100 100      2    26  0.21310\n137 cells\ncount    137.000000\nmean      49.437956\nstd        4.687062\nmin        1.000000\n25%       50.000000\n50%       50.000000\n75%       50.000000\nmax       50.000000\ndtype: float64\n=== cost_model docstring\n\"\"\"§19 (plan 2 §2.3, loop0003 item 05): can the cost of a refutation be predicted before it is run?\n\nThe question. `benchmarks.recertify` allocates five-day budgets blind